What is Personalized Glass?
Personalized glass is a niche yet rapidly growing segment of the broader specialty glass industry. Unlike mass‑produced glass sheets, these products are engineered to reflect unique design intents-ranging from brand‑centric promotional items to high‑impact architectural façades. By integrating high‑resolution digital inkjet, UV‑cured, or laser‑etch processes, manufacturers can achieve intricate multi‑color graphics, tactile textures, and even functional coatings (e.g., anti‑UV, low‑emissivity) on a single piece of glass.
